Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:14.80,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}费尔南德斯 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}7{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}0{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 吉布森 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, first of all, I would like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 我想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,to congratulate Talia and your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝贺塔莉娅和你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.44,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys did an amazing job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们做得太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You're an amazing player
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是一位很出色的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and an even better person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,人更出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我相信你还会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to have many more finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进更多决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,And, hopefully you're going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,也希望你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to get a couple more titles, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,再多拿几个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,not against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,别是对我就行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:19.44,EN,,0,0,0,,but I know like you're playing amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我知道 你现在打得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:21.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So, continue on the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 继续沿着这条路走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.32,EN,,0,0,0,,You're doing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:30.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I also want to thank my coach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也想谢谢我的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,who is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,他今天就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,My coaches who are back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有在家里的教练们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:36.00,EN,,0,0,0,,my family who are back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:36.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,在家里的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:37.04,EN,,0,0,0,,my team members
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:37.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有我团队里的成员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:38.16,EN,,0,0,0,,who are traveling around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们正跟着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:39.68,EN,,0,0,0,,the world helping out my sister
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我妹妹和另一位球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and another player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,满世界跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for all the hard work,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们所有的付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:43.60,EN,,0,0,0,,the sacrifices,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有的牺牲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and the day in and day out belief in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有日复一日对我的信任
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.44,EN,,0,0,0,,It truly means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对我意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you so much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 真的很感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.56,EN,,0,0,0,,for always being in my corner and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们一直站在我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:54.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and pushing me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:54.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,推着我往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I also want to thank everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也想谢谢每一位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.80,EN,,0,0,0,,who made this tournament possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这项赛事得以举办的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.56,EN,,0,0,0,,the tournament directors,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛事总监
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.36,EN,,0,0,0,,supervisors, chairs, ball kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,督导 裁判 球童
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:12.24,EN,,0,0,0,,the volunteers, you guys truly made
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:12.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,志愿者 是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,this week super special, not only for myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这一周变得特别 不只是对我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,but for every player who came to play
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,也对每一位来这里打球的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,in Singapore is an amazing experience
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,新加坡都是一段很棒的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and hopefully we get to come back here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望我们还能回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and experience this kind of level
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,再一次感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,of welcome, this level of professionalism
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,热情接待 这样的专业
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:31.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and also this level of love for many years
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:31.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有这样的热爱 很多很多年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:34.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:40.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And then finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:40.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:43.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I would like to thank all the Singaporean fans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想谢谢所有新加坡球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:47.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and the Pinoy fans who came to watch
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有来看球的菲律宾球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,who came to watch this whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一整周都来看球的你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Not only my matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是看我的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.40,EN,,0,0,0,,but everybody's matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,而是每个人的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys made
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,this week extremely special
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这一周格外特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:58.80,EN,,0,0,0,,with all your encouragements,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:58.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们的鼓励
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,the energy and the positivity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们带来的能量和正能量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that you brought in everyone's matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,带进了每一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,It truly meant a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对我意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们来看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to watch women's tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,女子网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:07.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and hopefully you guys get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,也希望你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to watch many more matches live
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,还能看更多场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:12.86,EN,,0,0,0,,and in person, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:12.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,在现场亲眼看
